menu "Skelly eye camera"
config SKELLY_SYNTHETIC
    bool "Use synthetic pixels instead of the physical sensor"
    default n
    help
        USB bring-up only. Every returned frame has its synthetic flag set.
        Does not initialize the sensor or prove camera capture.
endmenu

config SKELLY_CSI_LANE_MBPS
    int "CSI receiver lane bit rate (requires bench verification)"
    range 400 800
    default 800
    help
        Register-table header says 800 Mbps; driver metadata says 400 MHz.
        Default follows the explicit bit-rate header. Change for measured
        bring-up only; compilation cannot resolve this upstream discrepancy.
